0px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\">2. How the Internet Works: Step-by-Step Flow<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAIHBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBwQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"TDBkbc#Ml18Xb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_2d\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBwQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">When you type a website address into your browser and press Enter, a precise chain of events occurs via <span jsuid=\"Tp90Te_2e\" class=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"mouseenter:&amp;Tp90Te_2e|ZUljYd;mouseleave:&amp;Tp90Te_2e|aXD3Gb;focusin:&amp;Tp90Te_2e|Mrjwi;focusout:&amp;Tp90Te_2e|CXhG2e;pointerdown:&amp;Tp90Te_2e|wndyDd;click:&amp;Tp90Te_2e|yrMC6;\" jscontroller=\"KMhGd#Mx1qPe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><a class=\"H23r4e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQy_kOegoIAggACAAIHBAC\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBwQAg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;source=web&amp;rct=j&amp;url=https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/system-design/client-server-model/&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQy_kOegoIAggACAAIHBAC&amp;opi=89978449&amp;cd&amp;psig=AOvVaw36bR3FLtyG3kl1q2JDqVWd&amp;ust=1789113246878000\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(153, 195, 255); border-bottom: 0px rgb(153, 195, 255);\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(153, 195, 255); border-bottom: 0px rgb(153, 195, 255);\">Client-Server Architecture</a><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/system-design/client-server-model/&quot;,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[{&quot;1218&quot;:[17,null,null,null,[1]]}]],17,null,&quot;Client-Server Model - GeeksforGeeks&quot;,&quot;The Client-Server Model is a network architecture in which clients send requests for resources or services, and servers process these requests, returning the required responses. Client: A device or program that requests data or services (e.g., web browser). Server: A system that stores resources, manages data, and responds to client requests. Request–response mechanism: Communication follows a structured cycle — client requests, server responds. Centralized management: Data and services are controlled from servers, improving security and consistency.&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/images?q\\u003dtbn:ANd9GcRDrNXyhyYZRuiz9exmLTSHOWoJsxj72ZzULyYfrjNC6UFB-vK6GnSn8G-po0aKaQhW-79ZIG6kIfejg7E&quot;,&quot;GeeksforGeeks&quot;,&quot;https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.geeksforgeeks.org\\u0026client\\u003dAIM\\u0026size\\u003d128\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL&quot;,[[1789026846878585,77884527,1546451306],nul