xt-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_46\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">User Action &amp; URL Breakdown:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The browser (client) looks at the web address (URL) you entered.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RW-pqVQi9Ic&amp;t=255\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://cybertalents.com/blog/client-server-architecture\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAIKBAI\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQCA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4c\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQCQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4d\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4e\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">DNS Lookup (The Address Book):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The computer queries a Domain Name System (DNS) server to translate the human-readable website name into a numerical IP address (like finding a name in a phone book to get a phone number).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yioOQ4ItYuo\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Twgqz4ZVIpo\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAIKBAP\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQDw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4k\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQEA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4l\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4m\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Establishing a Connection (IP &amp; Ports):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Armed with the server’s unique IP address and standard port number (such as port 443 for secure HTTPS traffic), the client routes a request packet across internet routers.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://medium.com/@sabita2025/day-1-system-design-understanding-how-the-internet-works-client-server-architecture-http-c0bfb30d3df5\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yioOQ4ItYuo\">2</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAIKBAW\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQFg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4s\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQFw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4t\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_4u\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Server Processing:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The web server receives the request on that specific port, runs necessary application logic, or fetches data from an internal database.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://blog.algomaster.io/p/client-server-architecture-explained\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAIKBAc\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQHA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_50\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQHQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_51\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_52\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">The Response:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The server packages the requested files (HTML, CSS, images, or JSON data) and sends them back over the network to your client\'s source IP address.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://dev.to/thecurlyhairdev/understanding-how-the-internet-works-a-beginners-guide-to-the-client-server-model-and-apis-2f18\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yioOQ4ItYuo\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://blog.algomaster.io/p/client-server-architecture-explained\">3</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAIKBAi\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCgQIg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0p