 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_5x\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCwQAg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_5y\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_5z\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">IP Address:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> A unique numerical label assigned to every device connected to the internet, acting like a mailing address.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAILBAD\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCwQAw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_60\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCwQBA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_61\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_62\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Ports:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Virtual communication endpoints on a server (comparable to apartment numbers or loading docks) that direct incoming traffic to the correct software service.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwj51s6txOOWAxVvbKQEHWr5LFwQi4wTegoIAggACAAILBAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCwQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_63\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCwQBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_64\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_65\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Load Balancer:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> A hardware or software tool placed in front of servers to distribute incoming client traffic across multiple machines, preventing overloads.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/~m2nagapp/courses/CS446/1195/Arch_Design_Activity/ClientServer.pdf\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yioOQ4ItYuo\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Twgqz4ZVIpo\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://medium.com/@sabita2025/day-1-system-design-understanding-how-the-internet-works-client-ser