nt-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Network layers<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> (the OSI or TCP/IP model)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_6n\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACC4QBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_6o\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_6p\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">How encryption works<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> in HTTPS and SSL/TLS certificates<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_6q\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACC4QBg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_6r\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Tp90Te_6s\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Advanced system design concepts<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> like microservices and caching</span></li></ul></div></div>', 1, NULL, 1, '2026-09-10 07:56:45', '2026-09-10 09:42:04');
INSERT INTO `lessons` (`id`, `module_id`, `title`, `description`, `content`, `position`, `estimated_minutes`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3, 1, 'Overview of programming languages', 'Welcome to Introduction to Software Development: Programming Languages & Code Editors. This course will teach you the fundamentals of how computers understand code and show you how to set up a professional development environment using Visual Studio Code (VS Code', '<div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi_26eLxeOWAxXUUaQEHVa0FPYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><div class=\"otQkpb\" aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" data-wiz-attrbind=\"aria-level=Lktdie_11/fLk2Md\" jscontroller=\"a7qCn#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_11\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\">Module 1: Overview of Programming Languages<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi_26eLxeOWAxXUUaQEHVa0FPYQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"TDBkbc#Ml18Xb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_12\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">A programming language is a structured set of instructions used to communicate with a computer. Because computers natively only understand binary (<code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_13\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">0<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>s and <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_14\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">1<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>s), humans write code in \"high-level\" languages, which are then translated into machine code.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></div><div class=\"yhAwj\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;Lktdie_1a|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"UTzWVc#U8DOt\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_1a\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi_26eLxeOWAxXUUaQEHVa0FPYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIDBAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAwQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><div class=\"otQkpb\" aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" data-wiz-attrbind=\"aria-level=Lktdie_1b/fLk2Md\" jscontroller=\"a7qCn#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_1b\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\">1. Categories of Programming Languages<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></div><ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"mPWODf#NS0kde\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_1c\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi_26eLxeOWAxXUUaQEHVa0FPYQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIDRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACA0QAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi_26eLxeOWAxXUU