rial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\">3. Master the Command Palette<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwi_26eLxeOWAxXUUaQEHVa0FPYQi4wTegoIAggACAAIQRAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACEEQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"TDBkbc#Ml18Xb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_90\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACEEQAQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">The <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_91\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Command Palette<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> is your command center. Press <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_92\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">Ctrl + Shift + P<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> (or <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"Lktdie_93\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">Cmd + Shift + P<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> on Mac) to open it. You can type any command here without lifting your hands from the keyboard—such as toggling your theme color, opening the integrated terminal, or formatting code. [<a href=\"https://www.udemy.com/course/master-vs-code/?srsltid=AfmBOoqNV-Um3N8zfYQIOIGufaFnjfv06qTI4xADVAxwhoridEnPrJem\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VqCgcpAypFQ&amp;t=2\">2</a>]</div></div>', 2, 1, 1, '2026-09-10 08:00:16', '2026-10-20 10:16:46');
