(4, 2, 'Page Structure and Semantic Elements', 'Web pages need a clear skeleton so browsers and screen readers understand the content.', '<div class=\"otQkpb\" aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" data-wiz-attrbind=\"aria-level=DWAFie_10/fLk2Md\" jscontroller=\"a7qCn#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"DWAFie_10\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\">1. The Global Skeleton<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"TDBkbc#Ml18Xb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"DWAFie_11\" data-hveid=\"CAAICxAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\">Every valid HTML5 document follows a strict structural hierarchy.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class=\"yhAwj\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;DWAFie_17|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"UTzWVc#U8DOt\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"DWAFie_17\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0