(5, 4, 'Backend Web Development', 'Welcome to Backend Web Development 101: Server-Side Programming, Routes, and APIs. This crash course covers how backend servers process data, handle routing, and communicate via APIs across three of the world\'s most dominant backend languages: PHP, Node.js (JavaScript), and Python', '<div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjPuv6PyOOWAxUGVaQEHSB-JPQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIChAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAoQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><div class=\"otQkpb\" aria-level=\"3\" role=\"heading\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" data-wiz-attrbind=\"aria-level=XN9ADb_11/fLk2Md\" jscontroller=\"a7qCn#ZxCkTb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_11\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\" style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(238, 240, 255);\">1: Core Concepts of the Backend<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjPuv6PyOOWAxUGVaQEHSB-JPQQi4wTegoIAggACAAICxAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACAsQAA\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 2