rial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1d\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQAg\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1e\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1f\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">The Request-Response Cycle:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The client (browser or mobile app) sends an HTTP Request (e.g., <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1g\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">GET /users<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>). The server processes it and sends back an HTTP Response containing data or HTML.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Extensions/Server-side/First_steps/Web_frameworks\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjPuv6PyOOWAxUGVaQEHSB-JPQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAH\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQBw\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1m\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQCA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1n\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1o\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Routing:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> The mechanism that maps an incoming URL path (like <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1p\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">/products<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>) and an HTTP method (<code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1q\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">GET<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>, <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1r\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">POST<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>, <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1s\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">PUT<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>, <code dir=\"ltr\" class=\"KDcb0c\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"hNviFe#redMub\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1t\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0.8px solid rgb(44, 46, 53);\">DELETE<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>) to a specific block of code.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kLfzDK4Yne0&amp;t=2174\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjPuv6PyOOWAxUGVaQEHSB-JPQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIERAO\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQDg\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_1z\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACBEQDw\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"XN9ADb_20\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230,