|||[]--></li></div><div data-bfc=\"\" class=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwioue_-yOOWAxUAUqQEHdRzN1QQi4wTegoIAggACAAIKxAF\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCsQBQ\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"k3Vmac_7g\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAAgACCsQBg\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"k3Vmac_7h\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"k3Vmac_7i\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\" style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);\">Database Migrations:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> Use tools like Flyway, Liquibase, or ORM tools (Sequelize, Alembic) to track and version schema changes instea